        rdfs:label "Kriegman et al. (2020, 2021) Xenobot evolutionary biomechanics & kinematic self-replication — Model fidelity to source: 93/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "Faithfully implements the Kriegman et al. (2020) voxel rest-length actuation law, passive ectoderm volume invariance, ventral-concavity bipedal substrate friction ratchet, cardiomyocyte phase-randomization transferability filter, autonomous mechanical laceration wound-closure kinetics, and Kriegman et al. (2021) C-shaped kinematic self-replication compaction law (L125-510), verified by 3 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems (0 sorrys) in `morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_083_xenobot_evolutionary_biobots.lean`." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
